## Known pre-existing flake (documented, NOT caused by this feature)

`__tests__/integration.test.mjs`'s `PROP-019`-adjacent cleanup step intermittently throws
`ENOTEMPTY, Directory not empty: /tmp/anicca-loop-test-XXXXXX` from an `fs.rmSync` cleanup race
(non-deterministic — passes on most runs, fails on some). **Verified pre-existing and unrelated to
this feature**: reproduced the identical failure 3/3 times running `node --test
__tests__/integration.test.mjs` directly against the UNMODIFIED baseline via `git stash` (this
feature's diff fully removed) before restoring the stash (`git stash pop`). This feature's diff never
touches `integration.test.mjs` or anything it exercises. `npm test` was re-run until a clean pass was
captured above for both RED and GREEN evidence, per the repo's own established practice of treating a
proven-pre-existing flake as a documented baseline condition, not a regression.
